# Capture-aware correction, end to end: da2_nyc

model `da2` · 40 frames · policy chosen on holo_in, holo_out, panox, s3 (held out: nyc): `{"tilt": "relevel_known", "nadir": "plane_fill", "vfov": "inpaint_erp", "yawblur": "wiener"}`

